# Android's default SAXParserFactory (namespace-processing Expat semantics, no
# external DTD fetch). JDK FactoryFinder reads this ServiceLoader entry before
# falling back to its own Xerces factory, so SAXParserFactory.newInstance()
# answers like libcore's does. Lives here because runtime/net_spi/META-INF/services
# is the one resource directory both build.sh and build_java_only.sh package
# (into macapk-loader.jar). See runtime/java/org/apache/harmony/xml/parsers/
# SAXParserFactoryImpl.java; bisect with MACAPK_SAX_ANDROID_DEFAULTS=0.
org.apache.harmony.xml.parsers.SAXParserFactoryImpl
